#: ../../source/reference/learn/generated/maxframe.learn.ensemble.RandomForestClassifier.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.learn.ensemble.RandomForestClassifier"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:1 of
msgid "A distributed random forest classifier."
msgstr "分布式随机森林分类器。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:3 of
msgid ""
"A random forest is a meta estimator that fits a number of decision tree "
"classifiers on various sub-samples of the dataset and uses averaging to "
"improve the predictive accuracy and control over-fitting."
msgstr ""
"随机森林是一种元估计器，它在数据集的不同子样本上拟合多个决策树分类器，并"
"通过平均来提高预测精度和控制过拟合。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:7 of
msgid ""
"This distributed implementation trains all trees simultaneously using a "
"single pass over the data per tree level, which is significantly more "
"efficient than training trees independently. Bootstrap sampling is "
"handled via per-tree Poisson-distributed sample weights at the partition "
"level."
msgstr ""
"此分布式实现通过每个树层级对数据进行单次遍历来同时训练所有树，这比独立"
"训练树要高效得多。自助采样通过分区级别上每棵树的泊松分布样本权重来处理。"

#: ../../source/reference/learn/generated/maxframe.learn.ensemble.RandomForestClassifier.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:13 of
msgid "The number of trees in the forest."
msgstr "森林中树的数量。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:15 of
msgid ""
"The function to measure the quality of a split. Supported criteria are "
"\"gini\" for the Gini impurity and \"entropy\" for the information gain."
msgstr ""
"用于衡量分裂质量的函数。支持的判据为 \"gini\"（基尼不纯度）和 \"entropy\""
"（信息增益）。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:19 of
msgid ""
"The maximum depth of the tree. If None, then nodes are expanded until all"
" leaves are pure or until all leaves contain less than min_samples_split "
"samples."
msgstr ""
"树的最大深度。如果为 None，则节点会一直展开，直到所有叶节点纯度达标，或"
"所有叶节点包含的样本数少于 min_samples_split。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:23 of
msgid ""
"The maximum number of bins used to discretize continuous features. See "
":class:`~maxframe.learn.tree.DecisionTreeClassifier` for details."
msgstr ""
"用于将连续特征离散化的最大分箱数。详情请参阅 :class:`~maxframe.learn.tree"
".DecisionTreeClassifier`。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:27 of
msgid "The minimum number of samples required to split an internal node."
msgstr "分裂内部节点所需的最小样本数。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:29 of
msgid "The minimum number of samples required to be at a leaf node."
msgstr "叶节点所需的最小样本数。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:31 of
msgid ""
"The minimum weighted fraction of the sum total of weights required to be "
"at a leaf node."
msgstr "权重总和中叶节点所需的最小加权比例。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:34 of
msgid ""
"The number of features to consider when looking for the best split. Note:"
" \"auto\" is not supported; use \"sqrt\" explicitly.  - If int, then "
"consider `max_features` features at each split. - If float, then "
"`max_features` is a fraction and   `max(1, int(max_features * "
"n_features))` features are considered. - If \"sqrt\", then "
"`max_features=sqrt(n_features)`. - If \"log2\", then "
"`max_features=log2(n_features)`."
msgstr ""
"寻找最佳分裂时考虑的特征数。注意：不支持 \"auto\"；请显式使用 \"sqrt\"。 "
" - 如果为 int，则每次分裂考虑 `max_features` 个特征。  - 如果为 float，则"
" `max_features` 为比例，且考虑 `max(1, int(max_features * n_features))` "
"个特征。  - 如果为 \"sqrt\"，则 `max_features=sqrt(n_features)`。  - 如果"
"为 \"log2\"，则 `max_features=log2(n_features)`。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:34 of
msgid ""
"The number of features to consider when looking for the best split. Note:"
" \"auto\" is not supported; use \"sqrt\" explicitly."
msgstr "寻找最佳分裂时考虑的特征数。注意：不支持 \"auto\"；请显式使用 \"sqrt\"。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:37 of
msgid "If int, then consider `max_features` features at each split."
msgstr "如果为 int，则每次分裂考虑 `max_features` 个特征。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:38 of
msgid ""
"If float, then `max_features` is a fraction and `max(1, int(max_features "
"* n_features))` features are considered."
msgstr ""
"如果为 float，则 `max_features` 为比例，且考虑 `max(1, int(max_features *"
" n_features))` 个特征。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:40 of
msgid "If \"sqrt\", then `max_features=sqrt(n_features)`."
msgstr "如果为 \"sqrt\"，则 `max_features=sqrt(n_features)`。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:41 of
msgid "If \"log2\", then `max_features=log2(n_features)`."
msgstr "如果为 \"log2\"，则 `max_features=log2(n_features)`。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:43 of
msgid ""
"Whether bootstrap samples are used when building trees. If False, the "
"whole dataset is used to build each tree."
msgstr "构建树时是否使用自助样本。如果为 False，则使用整个数据集来构建每棵树。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:46 of
msgid ""
"Whether to use out-of-bag samples to estimate the generalization score.  "
".. warning::     Out-of-bag scoring is not yet implemented. Setting     "
"``oob_score=True`` will raise ``NotImplementedError``."
msgstr ""
"是否使用袋外样本来估计泛化得分。  .. warning::     袋外评分尚未实现。设置"
" ``oob_score=True`` 将引发 ``NotImplementedError``。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:46 of
msgid "Whether to use out-of-bag samples to estimate the generalization score."
msgstr "是否使用袋外样本来估计泛化得分。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:50 of
msgid ""
"Out-of-bag scoring is not yet implemented. Setting ``oob_score=True`` "
"will raise ``NotImplementedError``."
msgstr "袋外评分尚未实现。设置 ``oob_score=True`` 将引发 ``NotImplementedError``。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:53 of
msgid ""
"Controls both the randomness of the bootstrapping of the samples used "
"when building trees (if ``bootstrap=True``) and the sampling of the "
"features to consider when looking for the best split at each node."
msgstr ""
"同时控制构建树时使用的样本自助采样（当 ``bootstrap=True`` 时）的随机性，"
"以及在每个节点寻找最佳分裂时特征采样的随机性。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:58 of
msgid "Controls the verbosity when fitting and predicting."
msgstr "控制拟合和预测时的详细程度。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:60 of
msgid ""
"If bootstrap is True, the number of samples to draw from X to train each "
"base estimator.  - If None (default), then draw `X.shape[0]` samples. - "
"If int, then draw `max_samples` samples. - If float, then draw "
"`max(round(n_samples * max_samples), 1)`   samples. Thus, `max_samples` "
"should be in the interval   `(0.0, 1.0]`."
msgstr ""
"如果 bootstrap 为 True，则从 X 中抽取用于训练每个基估计器的样本数。  - "
"如果为 None（默认），则抽取 `X.shape[0]` 个样本。  - 如果为 int，则抽取 `"
"max_samples` 个样本。  - 如果为 float，则抽取 `max(round(n_samples * max_"
"samples), 1)` 个样本。因此，`max_samples` 应在 `(0.0, 1.0]` 区间内。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:60 of
msgid ""
"If bootstrap is True, the number of samples to draw from X to train each "
"base estimator."
msgstr "如果 bootstrap 为 True，则从 X 中抽取用于训练每个基估计器的样本数。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:63 of
msgid "If None (default), then draw `X.shape[0]` samples."
msgstr "如果为 None（默认），则抽取 `X.shape[0]` 个样本。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:64 of
msgid "If int, then draw `max_samples` samples."
msgstr "如果为 int，则抽取 `max_samples` 个样本。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:65 of
msgid ""
"If float, then draw `max(round(n_samples * max_samples), 1)` samples. "
"Thus, `max_samples` should be in the interval `(0.0, 1.0]`."
msgstr ""
"如果为 float，则抽取 `max(round(n_samples * max_samples), 1)` 个样本。"
"因此，`max_samples` 应在 `(0.0, 1.0]` 区间内。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:69 of
msgid ""
"The maximum memory in MB to use for aggregating statistics for a group of"
" nodes during training. When training many trees, memory is shared across"
" all trees at the same level. Fewer trees per group are processed when "
"the budget is exceeded."
msgstr ""
"训练期间用于聚合一组节点统计信息的最大内存（MB）。当训练大量树时，内存由"
"同一层级的所有树共享。当超出预算时，每组处理的树数会减少。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:74 of
msgid ""
"The strategy for selecting features at each node split:  - \"auto\": "
"\"sqrt\" for classification, \"onethird\" for regression. - \"sqrt\": "
"ceil(sqrt(n_features)) features. - \"log2\": max(1, "
"ceil(log2(n_features))) features. - \"onethird\": ceil(n_features / 3) "
"features. - \"all\": all features (equivalent to bagging without feature"
"   subsampling). - If int: the exact number of features."
msgstr ""
"每个节点分裂时选择特征的策略：  - \"auto\"：分类用 \"sqrt\"，回归用 \""
"onethird\"。  - \"sqrt\"：ceil(sqrt(n_features)) 个特征。  - \"log2\"："
"max(1, ceil(log2(n_features))) 个特征。  - \"onethird\"：ceil(n_features "
"/ 3) 个特征。  - \"all\"：所有特征（等同于无特征子采样的 bagging）。  - "
"如果为 int：特征的确切数量。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:74 of
msgid "The strategy for selecting features at each node split:"
msgstr "每个节点分裂时选择特征的策略："

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:76 of
msgid "\"auto\": \"sqrt\" for classification, \"onethird\" for regression."
msgstr "\"auto\"：分类用 \"sqrt\"，回归用 \"onethird\"。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:77 of
msgid "\"sqrt\": ceil(sqrt(n_features)) features."
msgstr "\"sqrt\"：ceil(sqrt(n_features)) 个特征。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:78 of
msgid "\"log2\": max(1, ceil(log2(n_features))) features."
msgstr "\"log2\"：max(1, ceil(log2(n_features))) 个特征。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:79 of
msgid "\"onethird\": ceil(n_features / 3) features."
msgstr "\"onethird\"：ceil(n_features / 3) 个特征。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:80 of
msgid "\"all\": all features (equivalent to bagging without feature subsampling)."
msgstr "\"all\"：所有特征（等同于无特征子采样的 bagging）。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:82 of
msgid "If int: the exact number of features."
msgstr "如果为 int：特征的确切数量。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:87 of
