#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:160 of
msgid "**Distributed Algorithm**"
msgstr "**分布式算法**"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:162 of
msgid ""
"All trees in the forest are trained simultaneously using a single "
"distributed data pass per tree level. This is much more efficient than "
"training trees independently, as the cost of a data pass is amortized "
"across all trees."
msgstr ""
"森林中的所有树通过每个树层级进行单次分布式数据遍历来同时训练。这比独立"
"训练树高效得多，因为数据遍历的成本由所有树分摊。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:167 of
msgid "The training process:"
msgstr "训练过程："

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:169 of
msgid ""
"**Bootstrap sampling**: For each tree, per-sample weights are drawn from "
"a Poisson(1) distribution at each partition, effectively creating "
"bootstrap samples without data movement."
msgstr ""
"**自助采样**：对每棵树，在每个分区上从泊松(1)分布中抽取每样本权重，从而在"
"不移动数据的情况下有效地创建自助样本。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:172 of
msgid ""
"**Feature subsampling**: At each node, a random subset of features "
"(controlled by ``feature_subset_strategy``) is selected. The same random "
"seed ensures consistent feature selection across partitions."
msgstr ""
"**特征子采样**：在每个节点，选择一个随机特征子集（由 ``feature_subset_"
"strategy`` 控制）。相同的随机种子确保跨分区的特征选择一致性。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:175 of
msgid ""
"**Sufficient statistics aggregation**: Per-bin class counts are "
"aggregated across all partitions and reduced via a shuffle operation for "
"all trees simultaneously."
msgstr ""
"**充分统计量聚合**：每个分箱的类别计数在所有分区上聚合，并通过 shuffle "
"操作同时为所有树进行归约。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:178 of
msgid ""
"**Split evaluation**: Best splits are found independently for each tree "
"using the merged statistics."
msgstr "**分裂评估**：使用合并后的统计信息为每棵树独立地寻找最佳分裂。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:181 of
msgid "**Limitations compared to scikit-learn**"
msgstr "**与 scikit-learn 相比的限制**"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:183 of
msgid ""
"In addition to the limitations documented in "
":class:`~maxframe.learn.tree.DecisionTreeClassifier`:"
msgstr ""
"除了 :class:`~maxframe.learn.tree.DecisionTreeClassifier` 中记录的限制"
"之外："

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:186 of
msgid ""
"``n_jobs``: Not applicable. Distributed parallelism is handled "
"automatically by the MaxCompute execution engine."
msgstr "``n_jobs``：不适用。分布式并行由 MaxCompute 执行引擎自动处理。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:188 of
msgid ""
"``warm_start``: Not supported. Incremental forest training is not "
"available in the distributed setting."
msgstr "``warm_start``：不支持。分布式环境中无法进行增量森林训练。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:190 of
msgid "``class_weight``: Not yet supported."
msgstr "``class_weight``：尚未支持。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:191 of
msgid "``oob_score``: Not yet implemented."
msgstr "``oob_score``：尚未实现。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:192 of
msgid "``ccp_alpha``: Cost-complexity pruning is not supported."
msgstr "``ccp_alpha``：不支持代价复杂度剪枝。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:193 of
msgid "``monotonic_cst``: Monotonicity constraints are not supported."
msgstr "``monotonic_cst``：不支持单调性约束。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:195 of
msgid "**Performance Considerations**"
msgstr "**性能考量**"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:197 of
msgid ""
"Training time scales with the deepest tree, not the average depth, since "
"all trees are grown level-by-level together."
msgstr "训练时间与最深的树成正比，而非平均深度，因为所有树都是逐层共同生长的。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:199 of
msgid ""
"The total memory per iteration is proportional to ``n_estimators * "
"n_features * max_bins * n_classes``. For very large forests, reduce "
"``max_bins`` or ``max_memory_in_mb``."
msgstr ""
"每次迭代的总内存与 ``n_estimators * n_features * max_bins * n_classes`` "
"成正比。对于非常大的森林，请减小 ``max_bins`` 或 ``max_memory_in_mb``。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestClassifier:202 of
msgid ""
"The number of distributed communication rounds equals the maximum tree "
"depth across all trees."
msgstr "分布式通信轮次等于所有树中的最大树深度。"

